# Ral, Crackling Wit, -10: "Draw three cards. You get an emblem with 'Instant and sorcery spells you cast have storm.'"
# Ral reaches 10 loyalty: 4 on entering, +1 on turns 1, 3 and 5 (7), then three noncreature spells (Mox Emerald, Mox Amber,
# Mox Ruby) cast on turn 7 put a counter each (10). Ral's -10 draws three (hand 5 -> 5 after the three Moxen were cast and the
# turn's draw: the check below) and Ral, at 0 loyalty, dies. Bot1 then casts Lightning Bolt: the emblem gives it storm, the
# three spells cast before it this turn make three copies, so Bot2 takes four Bolts (12), not 3. The Ornithopter cast after
# it is a creature spell, which the emblem does not touch: one Ornithopter, no copies. On turn 8 Bot2 casts two Lightning
# Bolts at Bot1 and the emblem is not Bot2's: the second has no storm, Bot1 takes 6, not 9.

